---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1> THE HALL OF FAME</h1>
			<p>
				The Terrence Clarke Memorial League is a 6 man dynasty league that has been running since 2020.
				It's a standard dynasty league with one major twist.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>It is a traditional 9-cat format</li>
				<li>You can only make additions during the Summer or Winter expansion drafts</li>
				<li>Two additional teams exist: one made of cut players and one made of eligible but never drafted players.</li>
				<li>You can ONLY pick players who have not lost their rookie status</code></li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Essentially, no players before Anthony Edwards can be selected in our league.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
